WEBVTT

00:09:56.956 --> 00:10:00.596
So one of the things is
we all have to get very clear

00:10:00.596 --> 00:10:03.036
about what the pay gap is about.

00:10:03.036 --> 00:10:06.236
Now, the pay gap is not about gender,

00:10:06.276 --> 00:10:08.116
and it's not even about care work.

00:10:08.156 --> 00:10:09.556
It's about mothers.

00:10:09.596 --> 00:10:11.876
The reason why there is
a gender gap in pay

00:10:11.876 --> 00:10:14.996
is the pay gap between
mothers and fathers.

00:10:14.996 --> 00:10:19.796
In fact, the largest pay gap exists
between mothers and childless women.

00:10:20.516 --> 00:10:24.676
And so we have got to,
once and for all, close the pay gap.

00:10:24.676 --> 00:10:25.956
So, for example,

00:10:25.956 --> 00:10:28.476
if you leave the workforce to have a child

00:10:28.476 --> 00:10:30.916
or take a break or whatever it is,